00:25:38,470 --> 00:25:41,125
- And what brings you here?  Its a honou!
- Do you remember my daughter Rosinha?

451
00:25:41,165 --> 00:25:46,062
Oxê, of course! Straight hair, black eyes,
width shoulders, big breasts, little waist...

452
00:25:46,087 --> 00:25:49,118
- Don't go far or you will be in trouble!
- With all due respect, Major...

453
00:25:49,143 --> 00:25:51,835
With all due respect, when
she left, she was a child.

454
00:25:51,845 --> 00:25:54,066
Well then, Rosinha has been a little sick...

455
00:25:54,066 --> 00:25:57,505
and it's coming from Recife
to rest at the farm.

456
00:25:57,756 --> 00:26:01,896
But like all woman, she
loves going to church.

457
00:26:02,265 --> 00:26:06,125
He asked me to get the priest to give her his blessing.

458
00:26:06,165 --> 00:26:09,804
- Holy Mary, what do we do, Chicó?
- I don't know, I have nothing to do with it.

459
00:26:09,829 --> 00:26:13,137
Holy Mary, let's stop him before he meets the priest.

460
00:26:13,162 --> 00:26:16,406
You are the one who invented this story, who
likes messes. Now sort it out!

461
00:26:16,431 --> 00:26:19,955
But you went with me! Now, help me out!

462
00:26:20,025 --> 00:26:22,057
- No way!
- Come on, Chicó.

463
00:26:22,082 --> 00:26:24,758
You're used to these
matters. You had a blessed horse!

464
00:26:24,783 --> 00:26:27,394
Antonio Moraes can be a horse,

465
00:26:27,700 --> 00:26:29,835
but for  sure he isn't blessed!

466
00:26:35,573 --> 00:26:38,225
Major Moraes!
How are you?

467
00:26:38,250 --> 00:26:41,646
- Just as you can see.
- Great! you look very well! Are Looking for the priest?

468
00:26:41,671 --> 00:26:43,570
- You´re  asking too much.
- Do you want me to...

469
00:26:43,595 --> 00:26:46,091
get him?
- If I did, I'd have told you to.

470
00:26:46,119 --> 00:26:47,869
I just wanted to warn you for you not to be shocked

471
00:26:47,894 --> 00:26:49,765
The priest is going mad.

472
00:26:50,160 --> 00:26:52,781
- The priest? Mad?
- Yes, the priest!

473
00:26:52,809 --> 00:26:55,650
He won't respect anyone...

474
00:26:55,675 --> 00:26:57,215
and wants to bless everything.

475
00:26:58,025 --> 00:27:00,273
I brought him a message from
my boss, but I was ill-treated...

476
00:27:00,298 --> 00:27:03,309
...in spite of who my boss is.

477
00:27:03,334 --> 00:27:05,297
- Who's your boss?
- The baker!

478
00:27:05,705 --> 00:27:08,849
He said he was a dog,
but he'd bless him anyway.

479
00:27:08,874 --> 00:27:12,042
- That's insane!
- I know , but it's his thing now.

480
00:27:12,321 --> 00:27:16,264
- He blesses everything
and calls us a dog.
- That is with your boss.

481
00:27:16,270 --> 00:27:18,336
With me, it'll be different.
- Forgive me, ...

482
00:27:18,337 --> 00:27:20,483
but I disagree.
- You disagree?

483
00:27:20,508 --> 00:27:22,981
Yes, because he said...

484
00:27:23,006 --> 00:27:25,743
"That dog puts on airs because
he's the Major's friend."

485
00:27:25,768 --> 00:27:27,850
What are you saying?

486
00:27:27,978 --> 00:27:31,644
Are you sure?
- Positive! The poor priest
has gone loony..

487
00:27:31,669 --> 00:27:35,235
I'll clear this up.
Someone will pay for this!

488
00:27:35,270 --> 00:27:38,613
- Can you spare some change?
- Get yourself a job!

489
00:27:39,599 --> 00:27:42,416
I can't work, sir.
I only have one eye.

490
00:27:42,441 --> 00:27:45,174
Poke the other one out
and sing at a  fair!

491
00:27:45,631 --> 00:27:50,668
It's a great honor to see
Major Antonio Moraes in church!

492
00:27:50,693 --> 00:27:54,245
It's been a while since you
last visited the house of GOD

493
00:27:54,275 --> 00:27:57,000
You mean I haven't been
to Mass in a long time.

494
00:27:57,229 --> 00:28:00,505
Not at all! I'm aware of
your duties, your health.

495
00:28:00,535 --> 00:28:04,099
You know I don't work
and my health is perfect!

496
00:28:04,124 --> 00:28:11,045
What brings you here?
You needn't tell me the little one is sick.

497
00:28:11,070 --> 00:28:12,725
- How did you know?

498
00:28:12,750 --> 00:28:16,005
Word gets around
pretty quickly.

499
00:28:16,350 --> 00:28:19,027
- Does it stink yet?
- Stink? What?

500
00:28:19,172 --> 00:28:22,555
- Your little one.
- No! What do you mean by that?

501
00:28:22,580 --> 00:28:25,256
- Nothing. Manner of speaking.

502
00:28:25,281 --> 00:28:28,116
Well, you go with a very weird way of talking!

503
00:28:28,141 --> 00:28:31,370
Forgive this old,
ignorant priest.

504
00:28:31,546 --> 00:28:35,060
- What ails her? The mange?
- The mange?

505
00:28:35,237 --> 00:28:38,840
Yes. I've seen one die
of it within a few hours.

506
00:28:39,100 --> 00:28:43,452
It started on her tail and
spread to her whole body.

507
00:28:43,493 --> 00:28:47,700
- On her "tail"?
- I'm sorry.
I should've said "stern".

508
00:28:47,870 --> 00:28:52,220
We owe respect to those that are ill,
even if they are inferior beings.

509
00:28:52,245 --> 00:28:54,010
"Inferior beings"?

510
00:28:55,570 --> 00:28:58,071
Father, beware!

511
00:28:58,096 --> 00:29:02,593
The church is the pillar of society,
but there's a limit to everything!

512
00:29:02,708 --> 00:29:06,600
- What did I say?
- "Inferior beings"!

513
00:29:06,625 --> 00:29:10,468
My full name is Antonio
Noronha de Brito Moraes!

514
00:29:10,493 --> 00:29:13,370
"Noronha de Brito" comes
from the Count of Arcs!

515
00:29:13,400 --> 00:29:15,750
My people came
in the caravels!

516
00:29:15,775 --> 00:29:20,395
Surely! And the little one's
forebears did too, right?

517
00:29:20,420 --> 00:29:24,212
Of course!
If mine did, so did hers.

518
00:29:24,374 --> 00:29:29,080
What are you insinuating?
That her mother is...

519
00:29:29,110 --> 00:29:32,160
- A bitch!
- What did you say?

520
00:29:32,200 --> 00:29:35,220
- A bitch.
- Say it again!

521
00:29:35,245 --> 00:29:39,420
I see no harm in saying it.
Isn't her mother a bitch?

522
00:29:39,445 --> 00:29:43,270
i just don´t kill you beacuse you are a priest .

523
00:29:43,306 --> 00:29:45,223
I'll complain
to the Bishop!

524
00:29:45,710 --> 00:29:48,730
You were right. Appear on
Angicos that you will not regret.

525
00:29:49,971 --> 00:29:52,747
Someone tell me for love
God, what have I done?

526
00:29:52,920 --> 00:29:56,558
Nothing, nothing Father. This man  is may be crazy with an obsession for being big.

527
00:29:56,800 --> 00:29:58,830
Even the dog he wants
give nobility letter...

528
00:29:58,840 --> 00:30:01,790
I do everything to please him
and he will complain to the bishop.

529
00:30:02,010 --> 00:30:04,896
- Will the bishop suspend me?
- No! Before that...

530
00:30:04,921 --> 00:30:08,511
I go to Angicos and arrange everything.
- Are you really going, João? How?

531
00:30:08,595 --> 00:30:11,840
Leave it to me. Antonio Moraes
suddenly became my friend.

532
00:30:12,080 --> 00:30:13,940
Didn't see how you invited me
to go to the Angicos?

533
00:30:14,510 --> 00:30:18,210
Now it's like this, João Grilo over there,
Antonio Moraes here...

534
00:30:18,450 --> 00:30:20,271
He's completely upset.

535
00:30:20,299 --> 00:30:23,311
Well, arrange things João,
that you don't regret.

536
00:30:23,367 --> 00:30:26,630
It's called it's arranged. Now
I want a little favor from the priest.

537
00:30:26,670 --> 00:30:29,525
- I was already waiting for one of these.
- What am I going to ask for...

538
00:30:29,525 --> 00:30:31,635
it's much easier than
to fulfill the commandments.

539
00:30:31,820 --> 00:30:33,160
Say then, what is it?

540
00:30:33,190 --> 00:30:35,310
The woman's dog
from the baker is very sick.

541
00:30:35,380 --> 00:30:37,354
I wanted you to bless the little dog.

542
00:30:37,443 --> 00:30:40,501
Again? But is it possible?

543
00:30:40,529 --> 00:30:43,609
It's more than possible. Wouldn't you bless that of Major Antônio Moraes?

544
00:30:43,950 --> 00:30:47,100
- And the baker's dog is sick now?
- It is.

545
00:30:47,268 --> 00:30:51,085
oh What a land to have
sick dogs, that's all.

546
00:30:51,110 --> 00:30:54,180
And the craze is now blessing.
Bless all that is animal.

547
00:30:54,536 --> 00:30:57,270
- How is it, would you bless or wouldn´t you?
- Thinking well...

548
00:30:57,996 --> 00:31:02,042
I think it's better not to bless. Go away, go.
- And what do I say to Ms. Dora?

549
00:31:02,067 --> 00:31:05,803
Tell her the bishop is there,
and I only bless if he allows me.

550
00:31:05,858 --> 00:31:09,851
- An alms for the love of God.
- I will pray for your soul.

551
00:31:09,907 --> 00:31:13,227
Can you join with this pray a bowl of flour?

552
00:31:13,360 --> 00:31:18,003
The Church is only concerned with
spiritual food, my son.

553
00:31:18,959 --> 00:31:26,590
Oh, my little dog is dying,
we have no idea who is her mother.

554
00:31:27,564 --> 00:31:30,879
- Where is the priest to bless her, João Grilo?
- he Can't come.

555
00:31:32,830 --> 00:31:36,145
He said that the bishop is there and that he only blesses
if it was Antônio Moraes' dog...

556
00:31:36,170 --> 00:31:38,980
most important people. Otherwise, the bishop can complain.

557
00:31:39,274 --> 00:31:40,840
What are you talking about?

558
00:31:41,353 --> 00:31:44,672
So he can bless the Major's dog
Antônio Moraes, and not mine?!

559
00:31:45,127 --> 00:31:48,715
- What is this, what is this...
- I'm asking, what is it?

560
00:31:48,754 --> 00:31:51,740
After all, I'm
president of the Brotherhood of Souls.

561
00:31:51,870 --> 00:31:53,352
And that's something!

562
00:31:53,450 --> 00:31:57,210
The man is
president of the Brotherhood of Souls.

563
00:31:57,422 --> 00:31:59,705
For me this is a case
of blessed dog.

564
00:31:59,985 --> 00:32:02,497
Bless that dog soon
and we  will be in  peace.

565
00:32:02,806 --> 00:32:05,107
I won't bless it,
and that's my decision!

566
00:32:05,428 --> 00:32:08,970
I'm not prepared.
I have to think it over.

567
00:32:08,995 --> 00:32:12,486
You mean blessing
the Major's bitch was fine...

568
00:32:12,511 --> 00:32:14,770
but you have to think it over
when it's my bitch?

569
00:32:15,044 --> 00:32:18,907
My husband is the president
of the Brotherhood of Souls!

570
00:32:18,932 --> 00:32:22,063
- I'll make him resign!
- She'll make me resign!

571
00:32:22,088 --> 00:32:24,553
You won't get one
single loaf of bread!

572
00:32:24,578 --> 00:32:25,615
Not one!

573
00:32:26,459 --> 00:32:28,535
- And you get your bread for free!

574
00:32:28,540 --> 00:32:29,755
- You get it for free!

575
00:32:30,620 --> 00:32:33,675
And he pays for
the church repairs!

576
00:32:33,680 --> 00:32:35,265
- I pay for the repairs!

577
00:32:36,810 --> 00:32:39,685
- What's all this about?
- What is it about?

578
00:32:39,685 --> 00:32:43,906
This is the voice
of truth, Father. Now you'll see who
the baker's wife really is!

579
00:32:44,770 --> 00:32:46,251
- And what are you, then?

580
00:32:46,374 --> 00:32:48,085
- The cow!
- The cow?!

581
00:32:48,110 --> 00:32:50,635
The cow I lent you,
so you'd have milk.

582
00:32:50,870 --> 00:32:53,586
- I want it back today!
- Today!

583
00:32:53,611 --> 00:32:56,670
- Even the cow?
- You're overdoing it!

584
00:32:57,113 --> 00:33:00,285
And didn't I tell you
to stay with the bitch?

585
00:33:00,310 --> 00:33:01,845
- Didn't she?
- She did.

586
00:33:02,156 --> 00:33:05,545
- How is she?
- It's still got four paws, a nose...

587
00:33:05,570 --> 00:33:08,095
- Don't tell me she's worse!
- I won't.

588
00:33:08,120 --> 00:33:10,657
- But is she worst ? Tell us!
- Make up your minds!

589
00:33:10,682 --> 00:33:13,185
Don't tell me you let her die!

590
00:33:13,210 --> 00:33:16,372
- I didn't let her!
- Thank God!

591
00:33:16,397 --> 00:33:18,616
But you know
she never listens.

592
00:33:18,711 --> 00:33:21,615
Chicó! You should've
stayed with the bitch!

593
00:33:21,657 --> 00:33:24,695
If I had, who'd have brought
the news of it's death?

594
00:33:25,190 --> 00:33:30,700
My little bitch is dead!

595
00:33:32,863 --> 00:33:35,450
The bitch met its fate.

596
00:33:35,907 --> 00:33:38,640
It met the only
irreparable doom...

597
00:33:39,157 --> 00:33:42,090
that marks our strange
destiny on this Earth.

598
00:33:42,300 --> 00:33:44,120
The unexplainable fact...

599
00:33:44,125 --> 00:33:47,370
which puts all living things in one
flock of condemned creatures...

600
00:33:49,530 --> 00:33:52,100
because all that lives
shall die.

601
00:33:53,140 --> 00:33:56,270
"All that lives shall die."
Beautiful!

602
00:33:56,670 --> 00:34:00,200
Where did you hear that?
You sure didn't make it up.

603
00:34:00,230 --> 00:34:03,308
No, I didn't.
I heard it from a priest.

604
00:34:03,333 --> 00:34:06,210
- When my pirarucu died.
- Your pirarucu?

605
00:34:06,240 --> 00:34:07,390
Mine, that's a way of saying...

606
00:34:07,400 --> 00:34:09,990
Actually, I think I was his.
Didn't I tell you about him?

607
00:34:10,000 --> 00:34:11,990
No. I've heard of men owning fish,...

608
00:34:12,000 --> 00:34:13,710
but not the other way around!

609
00:34:14,002 --> 00:34:15,730
It happens when I was in Amazonas.

610
00:34:16,934 --> 00:34:18,580
I wrapped the harpoon rope
around my body and my arms.

611
00:34:18,590 --> 00:34:20,362
So I was with the
motionless arms.

612
00:34:20,387 --> 00:34:23,100
When it bit, it pulled me
into the river.

613
00:34:23,500 --> 00:34:26,395
- The fish caught you.
- Exactly! It caught me.

614
00:34:26,660 --> 00:34:30,370
In short, it dragged me
for 3 days and 3 nights.

615
00:34:30,426 --> 00:34:33,423
3 days and 3 nights?
Weren't you hungry?

616
00:34:33,448 --> 00:34:36,600
No, but I was
dying for a smoke!

617
00:34:37,397 --> 00:34:40,842
When it died, I waved my hands
and some people freed me.

618
00:34:40,892 --> 00:34:42,930
But weren't your hands tied?

619
00:34:42,960 --> 00:34:45,230
When things get tough,
you find a solution.

620
00:34:46,174 --> 00:34:50,418
- How did you do it?
- I don't know, but so it was.

621
00:34:50,443 --> 00:34:53,310
My little bitchie!

622
00:35:02,595 --> 00:35:05,010
We must all
resign ourselves.

623
00:35:05,183 --> 00:35:10,365
If you had blessed the little one
she'd still be alive!

624
00:35:10,410 --> 00:35:12,750
Waah, Waah. i Dont have this power!

625
00:35:12,775 --> 00:35:16,206
Just one thing: You have
to give her a decent burial!

626
00:35:16,430 --> 00:35:21,503
- A funeral for the bitch?
- Yes, and it has to be in Latin.

627
00:35:21,553 --> 00:35:24,720
- Or, it wont work.
-In Latin, it won't work.

628
00:35:24,810 --> 00:35:27,540
- In Latin, it will work.
- Yes, in Latin, it will work!

629
00:35:27,570 --> 00:35:32,025
You're all crazy!
I'm not giving the bitch a funeral!

630
00:35:32,835 --> 00:35:35,994
The Brotherhood will
lose its funding!

631
00:35:36,019 --> 00:35:40,565
- I won't do it!
- The Brotherhood has lost its funding!

632
00:35:40,590 --> 00:35:41,980
- I won't do it!

633
00:35:42,005 --> 00:35:44,700
- My husband resigns the presidency!

634
00:35:44,730 --> 00:35:48,284
- I won't do it!
- I resign the presidency!

635
00:35:48,309 --> 00:35:51,271
- I won't do it!
- The little cow...

636
00:35:51,563 --> 00:35:55,560
will be taken from the
church right away!

637
00:35:56,513 --> 00:36:00,516
- You heartless woman!
- Heartless?

638
00:36:02,380 --> 00:36:05,490
Because I don't want to see
the buzzards eat my bitch?

639
00:36:06,517 --> 00:36:09,930
- Will you bury her or not?
- If it were up to God,

640
00:36:09,940 --> 00:36:14,173
I'd do it. The problem is the Bishop!

641
00:36:15,423 --> 00:36:17,990
All you'll ever get is stale bread,
cash up-front!

642
00:36:18,020 --> 00:36:21,257
- You cruel woman!
- And for double the price!

643
00:36:21,282 --> 00:36:23,250
- Can you spare some change?
- No.

644
00:36:23,260 --> 00:36:25,594
- Help a poor one-eyed beggar!

645
00:36:25,594 --> 00:36:28,384
- Why should I?
Did I poke your eye out?

646
00:36:28,468 --> 00:36:32,090
- No, sir, you didn't.
- I can poke the other eye out,

647
00:36:32,130 --> 00:36:34,390
so I'd have to give you money.

648
00:36:34,445 --> 00:36:38,800
The bitch stays until
the priest agrees to bury her.

649
00:36:38,840 --> 00:36:41,410
But, dear, she's
starting to smell.

650
00:36:42,189 --> 00:36:46,789
Then you leave!
Maybe the stench won't be so bad!

651
00:36:48,703 --> 00:36:51,060
Give me a free hand,
and I'll get the bitch buried.

652
00:36:51,580 --> 00:36:53,860
- You've got it.
- Can I loose the purse strings?

653
00:36:56,080 --> 00:36:58,879
- Yes!
- This is going to be easy!

654
00:36:58,904 --> 00:37:01,690
- What are you up to getting?
- I'm getting the bitch a funeral.

655
00:37:01,700 --> 00:37:04,090
And in Latin!

656
00:37:09,518 --> 00:37:10,670
Do you want to die, dude?

657
00:37:10,862 --> 00:37:14,690
I will, but I take everything with me!

658
00:37:15,692 --> 00:37:18,006
- Seu Severino?
- And you know another one with my face?

659
00:37:18,163 --> 00:37:20,843
Good thing the beggar was you,
lucky I didn't have to kill him.

660
00:37:20,843 --> 00:37:23,897
- Finish your slack, dude
- I don't like to kill, no.

661
00:37:23,947 --> 00:37:26,891
- I kill, but I don't like it.
- Where were you going without my command?

662
00:37:26,916 --> 00:37:28,825
You were late,
I went to get you.

663
00:37:30,662 --> 00:37:34,841
I went all over town dressed as a beggar
and I didn't find any police.

664
00:37:35,620 --> 00:37:38,203
But there was no citizen to give me alms either!

665
00:37:38,228 --> 00:37:39,475
That's why I steal.

666
00:37:39,480 --> 00:37:41,945
I don't like to steal, but when the
person asks and is not given...

667
00:37:41,980 --> 00:37:44,945
But it was pretty good
that I got more angry with these people.

668
00:37:44,970 --> 00:37:48,605
Jeez, on this way won't escape
nobody in Taperoá.

669
00:37:48,900 --> 00:37:51,565
It will be easier than giving
slap in a drunk.

670
00:37:58,595 --> 00:38:00,795
- Father João?
- What is it?

671
00:38:01,359 --> 00:38:03,855
- I'm here for the cow.

672
00:38:03,940 --> 00:38:06,665
- What a heartless woman!

673
00:38:07,066 --> 00:38:11,465
If I could, I'd bury the bitch,
the cat, whatever!

674
00:38:11,836 --> 00:38:13,475
But the Bishop is in town!

675
00:38:13,740 --> 00:38:16,795
These folks are nuts.
They think pets are people.

676
